        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alex Ebert\n- Organizations: Ima Robot, of Montreal, Edward Sharpe and the Magnetic Zeros\n- Places: Los Angeles, California, Athens, Georgia\n- Products: “For a Better Day”\n- Companies: Universal Music\n- Concepts: experimental pop, EDM\n\nFacts:\n- Ima Robot is a band based in Los Angeles, California, and it formed in the late 1990s.\n- of Montreal is an American experimental pop band from Athens, Georgia.\n- Alex Ebert is best known as the lead singer and songwriter for the American bands Ima Robot and Edward Sharpe and the Magnetic Zeros.\n- “For a Better Day” is a 2015 single by Swedish EDM producer Avicii featuring uncredited vocals by American singer Alex Ebert.\n- Universal Music released “For a Better Day.”",
